			<item>
				<title>Demo: Sippy, 20 years from VoIP to AI and beyond</title>
				<link>https://www.rtpproxy.org/post/2026-opensips-summit-demo/</link>
				<pubDate>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://www.rtpproxy.org/post/2026-opensips-summit-demo/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sippy, 20 years from VoIP to AI and beyond: gamedev with Digger, microsippy and RTP.io&lt;/strong&gt;, by Maksym Sobolyev, at OpenSIPS Summit 2026 in Bucharest.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;An interactive demo including RTP.io, the OpenSIPS module that runs the RTPProxy inside the OpenSIPS process. The demo is part of the recording of the interactive demos day of the summit, the link below starts at the beginning of the demo.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div style=&#34;position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;iframe allow=&#34;accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share; fullscreen&#34; loading=&#34;eager&#34; referrerpolicy=&#34;strict-origin-when-cross-origin&#34; src=&#34;https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/1m9vrvvI9fY?autoplay=0&amp;amp;controls=1&amp;amp;end=0&amp;amp;loop=0&amp;amp;mute=0&amp;amp;start=7053&#34; style=&#34;position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border:0;&#34; title=&#34;Sippy, 20 years from VoIP to AI and beyond: gamedev with Digger, microsippy and RTP.io&#34;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1m9vrvvI9fY&amp;amp;t=7053s&#34;&gt;Watch on YouTube&lt;/a&gt; (starts at 1:57:33)&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Demo: Building software-defined networks with Sippy components</title>
				<link>https://www.rtpproxy.org/post/2025-opensips-summit-demo/</link>
				<pubDate>Thu, 29 May 2025 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://www.rtpproxy.org/post/2025-opensips-summit-demo/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Building intelligent, software-defined networks with SIP Proxima, Infernos, RTPProxy, B2BUA and other open-source Sippy components. Practical example: adding local real-time ASR into the Sippy SRS&lt;/strong&gt;, by Maksym Sobolyev, at OpenSIPS Summit 2025 in Amsterdam.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;An interactive demo of building networks out of the open-source Sippy components, including the RTPProxy. The demo is part of the recording of the third day of the summit, the link below starts at the beginning of the demo.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Talk: Enabling WebRTC in Infernos with Embedded RTPProxy</title>
				<link>https://www.rtpproxy.org/post/2025-opensips-summit-webrtc/</link>
				<pubDate>Wed, 28 May 2025 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://www.rtpproxy.org/post/2025-opensips-summit-webrtc/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enabling WebRTC in Infernos with Embedded RTPProxy&lt;/strong&gt;, by Maksym Sobolyev, at OpenSIPS Summit 2025 in Amsterdam.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Using the RTPProxy embedded into Infernos to enable WebRTC. The talk is part of the recording of the second day of the summit, the link below starts at the beginning of the talk.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div style=&#34;position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;iframe allow=&#34;accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share; fullscreen&#34; loading=&#34;eager&#34; referrerpolicy=&#34;strict-origin-when-cross-origin&#34; src=&#34;https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/lN96vOjhhhI?autoplay=0&amp;amp;controls=1&amp;amp;end=0&amp;amp;loop=0&amp;amp;mute=0&amp;amp;start=12580&#34; style=&#34;position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border:0;&#34; title=&#34;Enabling WebRTC in Infernos with Embedded RTPProxy&#34;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lN96vOjhhhI&amp;amp;t=12580s&#34;&gt;Watch on YouTube&lt;/a&gt; (starts at 3:29:40)&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Talk: The RTPProxy: Past, Present And Future</title>
				<link>https://www.rtpproxy.org/post/2023-kamailio-world/</link>
				<pubDate>Wed, 07 Jun 2023 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://www.rtpproxy.org/post/2023-kamailio-world/</guid>
